      "text": "[{\"insert\":\"A) OPTIONAL - ACTIVE RECOVERY WORK:\",\"attributes\":{\"size\":24,\"color\":\"#FFEE4B0F\"}},{\"insert\":\"\\n\",\"attributes\":{\"header\":1}},{\"insert\":\"40 minutes\\nGoal - complete 30 minutes of low-intensity steady-state movement today. Go for a jog, hike, walk, ruck, bike, or swim. If you want a GYM OPTION please use the following. You should keep your heart rate in the Zone 2 range. That can be calculated roughly as 65-75% of your theoretical maximal HR (220-age).\\n\"}]",
